# Deny everything, then allow only the runtime application, model evidence and
# deployment metadata. Training-only caches, Git history and local stores stay out.
*
!src/
!configs/
!scripts/
!requirements.txt
!pyproject.toml
!artifacts/model.pkl
!artifacts/model_card.md
!artifacts/metrics/
!artifacts/plots/
!artifacts/runs/
!data/
!docker/
!.github/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
